    {
      "text": "Mrs Hale waves from her window at 2am. She's been in hospital since June.",
      "scene": "house",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613321058083-79c96f7fa53c?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "BYsyOqtlaMo",
      "photo_credit": "Tobias Reich"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her house is dark, but her pale hand moves slowly, side to side.",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1641451029786-9caca048d9af?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "xAQdrztRZ9Y",
      "photo_credit": "Mingwei Lim"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next night, she was waving from her front porch.",
      "scene": "door",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1790465221331-c1fa6f9c64fb?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "midAYVrWZf8",
      "photo_credit": "Paul Lichtblau"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then from the middle of the street, barefoot, in her hospital gown.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566276423184-a8c13d2a88a1?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "8I-gdwRMw_M",
      "photo_credit": "Fawazlul Rizqi"
    },
    {
      "text": "Last night, she waved through the glass of my front door, and I waved back.",
      "scene": "door",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1632179050853-e52d710ed404?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "d7ZwU4kTcqM",
      "photo_credit": "semen zhuravlev"
    },
    {
      "text": "Since then, I haven't seen her outside once.",
      "scene": "hallway",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511406361295-0a1ff814c0ce?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "pcZvxrAyYoQ",
      "photo_credit": "charlesdeluvio"
    },
    {
      "text": "This morning, Mrs Hale came home from hospital and waved up at me.",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516575355332-d2934104e253?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "_41WmEwi8Ok",
      "photo_credit": "Tom Barrett"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then she asked who was waving behind me.",
      "scene": "dark",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1628105364240-de81cc89b054?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
